Z||000006||AL||04-08-2001||08:20 PM||||we've covered this before, but being fluent in spanish, fierce in spanish means feroz,and fiero in spanish means steel,i know you all are going to bring  out your dictionaries and tell me that steel is acero,and yes it is, but fiero is also another word for it.now proud means orgullo, so i don't know how gm got this fiero is proud stuff cause spanish and italian are almost the same.but saying fiero sure sounds good.||||reg||1
